
tlplay

    Example player application.

Usage:

    tlplay [input] [option],...

Arguments:

    input - One or more timelines, movies, or image sequences.

Testing Options:

    -exit - Start the user interface and then exit.

Style Options:

    -displayScale, -ds (value) - Set the display scale. A value of 0 sets the scale automatically.
    -colorStyle, -cs (value) - Set the color style. Options: "Dark", "Light", "Custom".

Options:

    -log - Print the log to the console.
    -help, -h, --help, --h - Show this message.

